{"subject":"Englisch","title":"Blue Line 1 – Unit 2 Vokabeln Teil 2 (S. 198–199)","key":"Blue Line 1 – Unit 2 (Vokabeln, Seite 198–199)\nSong «This is our classroom»: carpet, wall, door, board; with curtains we can pull; English is fun\nSchreiben/Lesen: to write, to read, question ↔ answer, group, to say\nWochentage: Monday (Mon), Tuesday (Tues), Wednesday (Wed), Thursday (Thurs), Friday (Fri), Saturday (Sat), Sunday (Sun)\nSchulfächer: Maths, English, German, French, Art, Music, Science, History, Geography, Biology, PE, RE, IT, DT\nRedewendungen: Here you are. – Thank you. / You're right. / at break\nto be good at: I'm good at English. I'm not good at Music. I'm very good at Maths.\nMs = Frau (Anrede), Mr = Herr","vocab":[["to open","öffnen; aufmachen"],["to look at","anschauen"],["board","Tafel"],["to do","machen; tun"],["Put your hands up.","Meldet euch."],["an","ein; eine"],["Here you are.","Bitte schön."],["Thank you.","Danke."],["so have a look around","also schau dich um"],["tell me what you see","sage mir, was du siehst"],["carpet","Teppich"],["for us all","für uns alle"],["wall","Wand"],["door","Tür"],["with curtains we can pull","mit Vorhängen, die wir zuziehen können"],["but","aber"],["I know","ich weiß"],["we come here every day","wir kommen jeden Tag hierher"],["here we all learn","hier lernen wir alle"],["It's easy, hooray!","Es ist einfach, hurra!"],["English is fun","Englisch macht Spaß"],["All together now!","Jetzt alle zusammen!"],["that's what it's all about","darum geht es"],["to write","schreiben"],["to read","lesen"],["question","Frage"],["answer","Antwort"],["group","Gruppe"],["to say","sagen; sprechen"],["Monday (Mon)","Montag"],["Tuesday (Tues)","Dienstag"],["Wednesday (Wed)","Mittwoch"],["Thursday (Thurs)","Donnerstag"],["Friday (Fri)","Freitag"],["Saturday (Sat)","Samstag"],["Sunday (Sun)","Sonntag"],["DT (Design Technology)","Technik"],["PE (Physical Education)","Sportunterricht"],["Maths","Mathe"],["French","Französisch"],["Art","Kunst"]